n/pages/sase-1uu/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build the artifact-link event snapshot once and reuse its [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]inputs[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]snapshot-reuse[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]Make preview_aggregate build one event snapshot instead of two (resolves[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task bead sase-1rt). Add a scoped, opt-in memo for durable event objects[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the parsed pending outbox, so repeated snapshots inside one publish,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]drain, or reconcile stop re-reading and re-validating unchanged inputs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gate aggregate write retries and publish rebuilds on the [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]caller deadline[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]deadline-aware-aggregate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after snapshot-reuse[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]Make _write_merged_aggregate stop retrying after a lost CAS race when [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the next preview cannot finish before the caller's deadline. Thread the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deadline through rebuild_aggregate, reconcile_aggregate, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish-path apply_events_to_aggregate, with typed deferral handling in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]both chops. Add per-sub-phase publish timings.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stream per-stage progress from agent_publication project [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]drains[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]publication-drain-progress[dim] · [dim][/dim]after deadline-aware-aggregate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]Give drain_project a progress callback, so a slow or killed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent_publication tick leaves breadcrumbs for the stage it was in. Log [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the link drain's phase timings, including the new publish sub-phases, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the same way artifact_link_backfill already logs its drain phases.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1uu","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1uu.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-90472149b7ac67448488dd2cd40d8b63","started_at":"2026-11-21T16:01:32.184492+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"3a18695323529e08c978e6685ad73dd7568df41e3e660f76734e2550ba08a4a1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1uu.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"a606ab14092cb178dabda7b739080fdb431cd3ff57f6c95daa583499ebea6c46","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1uu.3/meta.json","size_bytes":655},"prompt":{"digest":"ea1e6ae0b8f7394454aa3736431ce2967abf8af2c644433eec39fced6c289a2d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1uu.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":162},"state":{"digest":"e27799c9195ac4431433cf2ee190a5ad1b6ad7d89f8231e28cad13b1a0c26302","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1uu.3/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-1uu.3","local_name":"sase-1uu.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-1uu","agent_clan_generation":"20261121110051","bead_id":"sase-1uu.3","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1uu","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1uu.3","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["sase-1uu.2"]},"source_run_id":"run-97c747039664546b3b9196b1b7e08f0b","started_at":"20261121110053","state":"waiting"},{"capabilities":